Sleep dysfunction is both a consequence and amplifier of Biological Dynamic instability.

Gastrointestinal Dysfunction
The coexistence of constipation, poor digestion, and reduced appetite suggests disturbances within gut-brain-immune communication pathways.

Interpretation
The Biological Dynamic Key demonstrated profound instability.
Immune, neurological, gastrointestinal, microbial, and inflammatory regulatory systems appeared to have lost coordinated control.
This domain likely represents the principal driver of disease progression.

