recovery capacity
quality of life
The restoration of neuroimmune communication therefore represents an important marker of systemic recovery.

13.8 Emergence of Adaptive Biological Networks
A defining feature of recovery was the appearance of adaptive rather than pathological biological networks.
At baseline, dominant networks included:
