The goal is to restore adaptive flexibility.
Biological systems must remain capable of responding appropriately to future challenges.

13.10 Restoration of Prakati
Within the Fundamental Medicine framework, Prakati represents the highest level of biological organization.
Prakati reflects the integrated expression of:
metabolic balance
