13.11 Network Harmonization as a Therapeutic Endpoint
The collective evidence from this case suggests that recovery cannot be fully explained through suppression of isolated pathological pathways.
Rather, recovery appears to result from progressive harmonization of multiple biological networks.
This process involves:
